  "description": "A small F# DSL and library for generating custom agent files for popular agent tools. Provides an immutable Agent AST, a Markdown writer, and a top-level computation expression DSL for ergonomic agent authoring.",
  "id": "FsAgent",
  "isPrerelease": false,
